sequenceDiagram
    participant Brand as 👔 Brand
    participant Frontend as Frontend App
    participant API as API Server
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Stripe as Stripe API
    participant Escrow as Escrow System
    participant Creator as 🎨 Creator
    
    Brand->>Frontend: Create Contract
    Frontend->>API: POST /contracts
    API->>Auth: Verify JWT Token
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid
    API->>Payment: Initialize Payment
    
    Payment->>Stripe: Create Payment Intent
    Stripe-->>Payment: Payment Intent ID
    Payment->>Escrow: Create Escrow Record
    Escrow-->>Payment: Escrow Created
    
    Payment-->>API: Payment Intent Ready
    API-->>Frontend: Payment Intent Client Secret
    Frontend->>Stripe: Redirect to Stripe Checkout
    Stripe-->>Brand: Payment Form (HTTPS)
    Brand->>Stripe: Enter Payment Details
    Stripe->>Stripe: Process Payment
    
    Stripe->>API: Webhook (Payment Succeeded)
    API->>API: Verify Webhook Signature
    API->>Escrow: Mark as FUNDED
    Escrow-->>API: Escrow Funded
    API->>Creator: Notify (Email/SMS)
    
    Creator->>API: Complete Work
    API->>Escrow: Mark as COMPLETED
    Escrow->>Payment: Release Funds
    Payment->>Stripe: Transfer to Creator
    Stripe-->>Payment: Transfer Complete
    Payment->>Escrow: Mark as RELEASED
    Escrow-->>Brand: Notify Completion
    Escrow-->>Creator: Notify Payment
